<title>UK: Household Bank sets 300 mln mark 5-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Household Bank sets 300 mln mark 5-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HOUSEHOLD BANK NEVADA</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  HOUSEHOLD FINANCE</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    29.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +0.125    PAY DATE    29.APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.838    FULL FEES   0.175</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.838</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ABN AMRO HOARE GOVETT IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
